    ('tablet-screen-repair', 'Tablet screen repair', 'Review options for cracked, damaged, or touch-unresponsive tablet screens.', 'This service describes inspection of a tablet display and touch components. Device construction and assessment determine the appropriate repair options.', 'tablets', 'SCREEN_REPAIR'),
